    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "UNITEDBUSINESS\nrejuvenation",
      "pre-arrival refreshment\nOur pre-arrival service includes\na variety of chilled juices, brewed tea\nand coffee, and warm croissants.\nChicken \u0026 Shrimp Jambalaya\nBe revived for your destination with a zesty chicken\nand shrimp jambalaya with basmati rice.\n-OR-\nFruit \u0026 Yogurt\nFor smaller appetites, enjoy a light seasonal fruit\nplate with creamy yogurt.\nescape\nfeatured wines\nThe wines served aboard United's flights\nare chosen in consultation with Doug Frost,\ncolumnist and author (On Wine, 2001;\nUncorking Wine, 1996). Mr. Frost has been\nnominated for the prestigious James Beard\nFoundation Award and is one of only three\npeople in the world to hold both the title of\nMaster Sommelier and Master of Wine. Mr.\nFrost and United have taken a truly global\nperspective in selecting wines for your\nappreciation and enjoyment. À votre santé!\nChampagne\nGremillet Brut NV Champagne\nWhite Wine\nSelbach Riesling Kabinett \"Feinherb\" Mosel, Germany 2007\nRobert Pepi Chardonnay 2007 California Estates\n-OR-\nJean-Claude Fromont Chablis 2008\nRed Wine\nM. Chapoutier 2007 Côtes-du-Rhône Belleruche\n-OR-\nAltos \"R\" Tempranillo 2007 Rioja\nPedroncelli Three Vineyards Cabernet Sauvignon 2007\nDry Creek Valley\n-OR-\nFinca la Escondida Reserva Malbec 2007 San Juan\nSake\nGekkeikan Sake Daiginjo is available on flights\nto and from Japan.\nSome wine selections are subject to change. Your\nficht attendant will intorm voll or the varieties that\nare available on today's flight.\nBeverages\nApéritifs, cocktails, spirits, liqueurs and beer\nSandeman Founders Reserve Porto will be offered during\nthe main meal's dessert.\nSTARBUCKS. coffee will be available throughout the flight."
    ],
